## Description

**Detection Type:** Behavioral Analytics

This behavioral detection identifies users who execute **PowerShell multiple times within a five-minute window**.

While a single PowerShell execution is often legitimate, repeated executions in a short period may indicate automated scripting, malware activity, post-exploitation, or attacker reconnaissance.

Rather than detecting a specific command, this analytic identifies abnormal execution patterns that warrant further investigation.

